---
import lightSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/votes-light.svg?raw';
import darkSvg from '../../assets/diagrams/votes-dark.svg?raw';
import Chart from './Chart.astro';
---

<Chart
  lightSvg={lightSvg}
  darkSvg={darkSvg}
  title="Three reads, one pile, 92% of the time"
  caption="How the three reads voted on the pile, across 812 applications."
>
  A single bar split in two. For 745 of 812 applications, 92 percent, all three reads agreed on the pile. For 67, the reads split two to one. There were no three-way splits.
</Chart>
